---
description: Sprint execution rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read delivery/CURRENT-SPRINT.json before work.
- Work only on tasks listed in the active Sprint manifest.
- Every task must bind to the active Build Spec ID and mapped Acceptance/Test IDs.
- Implement one task at a time unless explicitly marked parallel-safe.
- A task closes only after mapped tests pass and evidence is recorded.
- Do not silently expand scope.
- New work discovered during implementation becomes a Finding.
- The same implementation strategy may fail at most twice. After two failures, stop and record concrete evidence.
